NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000554 "(200 means OK, 4xx caller error, 5xx function error). Second element"
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000555 "($reason) is a string containing error message, or something like \"OK\" if status is"
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000556 "200. Third element ($payload) is the actual result, but usually not present when enveloped result is an error response ($status_code is not 2xx). Fourth"
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000557 "element (%result_meta) is called result metadata and is optional, a hash"
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000558 "that contains extra information, much like how HTTP response headers provide additional metadata."
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000559 ""
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000560 "Return value:  (any)"
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000561 ""
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000562 ""
