NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000596 ""
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000597 "=back"
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000598 ""
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000599 "Returns an enveloped result (an array)."
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000600 ""
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000601 "First element ($status_code) is an integer containing HTTP-like status code"
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000602 "(200 means OK, 4xx caller error, 5xx function error). Second element"
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000603 "($reason) is a string containing error message, or something like \"OK\" if status is"
