NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000622 "=head1 CONTRIBUTING"
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000623 ""
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000624 ""
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000625 "To contribute, you can send patches by email/via RT, or send pull requests on"
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000626 "GitHub."
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000627 ""
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000628 "Most of the time, you don't need to build the distribution yourself. You can"
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000629 "simply modify the code, then test via:"
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000630 ""
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000631 " % prove -l"
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000632 ""
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000633 "If you want to build the distribution (e.g. to try to install it locally on your"
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000634 "system), you can install L<Dist::Zilla>,"
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000635 "L<Dist::Zilla::PluginBundle::Author::PERLANCAR>,"
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000636 "L<Pod::Weaver::PluginBundle::Author::PERLANCAR>, and sometimes one or two other"
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000637 "Dist::Zilla- and/or Pod::Weaver plugins. Any additional steps required beyond"
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000638 "that are considered a bug and can be reported to me."
